{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/b62204a73ec91e5a8dc7d08f05b89334.avif?t=1770791956\" width=468 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the struggle for survival through the eyes of a restaurant owner in a small town under siege by monsters including supernatural creatures inspired by American folklore such as the Wendigo and zombies.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and sell delicious monster meat dishes and grow your Midwest restaurant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tPlace traps outside your restaurant to fend off unpredictable monster incursions.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMake difficult business decisions that ensure your survival or the destruction of Rapid City.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUnravel the mystery behind the monsters by diving into a deep narrative with characters that feel real.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How Far Will You Go to Keep Your Business Alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord and Facebook for more updates!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/2499cdd73ab0b016553cc58ff5f2b49a.avif?t=1770791956\" width=468 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/f96d5c075e4cafc51d74fb3bee5ccb33.poster.avif?t=1770791956\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/f96d5c075e4cafc51d74fb3bee5ccb33.webm?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/f96d5c075e4cafc51d74fb3bee5ccb33.mp4?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep BOTH your customers and business ALIVE by arming yourself, prepping your employees and setting up traps around the restaurant\u2026. because who knows when and what might attack? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/7575e5790b5a8efb320a61ed8255fd93.avif?t=1770791956\" width=468 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/acb647727460ffdf272acc1740d3521f.poster.avif?t=1770791956\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/acb647727460ffdf272acc1740d3521f.webm?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/acb647727460ffdf272acc1740d3521f.mp4?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Make bizarre yet surprisingly delicious-looking monster dishes from monster meat!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different dishes have different effects on your customers. And if those effects aren't strong enough, SPIKE them with <strong><i>missourite</i></strong> to increase their potency!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you how to set your menu!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember - your choices have consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spiking dishes with <i>missourite</i> might UNALIVE your customers and turn them into zombies!... or WORSE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/834548b06ee5fe9bd2a4b8c20eacea5f.avif?t=1770791956\" width=468 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/83d638b7c5fbb3332745bef41d1ba018.poster.avif?t=1770791956\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/83d638b7c5fbb3332745bef41d1ba018.webm?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/83d638b7c5fbb3332745bef41d1ba018.mp4?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your success depends on your business decisions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is profits all you care for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or do you put your community's welfare first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, your business decisions will determine your fate, and the fate of Rapid City.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/f042adec88a02fceab3bcf342bf6b783.avif?t=1770791956\" width=468 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/3acec4640b5e7966100a2adbe21ca869.poster.avif?t=1770791956\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/3acec4640b5e7966100a2adbe21ca869.webm?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/3acec4640b5e7966100a2adbe21ca869.mp4?t=1770791956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a small Midwest town  suffering  a New Great Depression and a mysterious monster invasion, even a restaurant manager can make a difference.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know 